Exercise: AI Product Owner for Spring Boot Developers
Objective

Create a Spring Boot REST API where the AI (using LangChain4j and an OpenAI model) acts as a Product Owner.

The AI should:

Decide a project topic.
Generate API requirements.
Suggest database tables.
List endpoints.
Generate sample JSON.
The developer then implements the APIs.
